        "translator": "K. M. K. Murthy / Desiraju Hanumanta Rao",
        "text": "\"These two saint-like Kusha and Lava, who also possess kingly features, but they are great hermits... this narration is endowing good fortune to me also, listen to that great efficacious legend [of Seetha...]\" [So said Rama to those courtiers.] [1-4-35]"
